{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手王灝兒（JW）與有米足球隊班主王至尊秘婚1年，早前出新歌公開婚訊，繼老公王至尊日前於社交晒相兼發表愛的宣言後，JW亦趁結婚一周年，於社交網發表感受，她寫道：「多謝你一直都支持我鼓勵我，畀好多嘅Inspiration我令到我繼續進步！</p><p>我哋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:23:56.564978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.713270+00:00","content_hash":"da3d175fbe19e3f4863fd618e457229f11dcb57827c7fc70546ba7851188fbec","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}